{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1266036-revamped-changing-breed-sheets-available-from-mr-gone","id":1266036,"title":"Revamped Changing Breed Sheets available from Mr. Gone!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-11-09T18:14:10-08:00","id":1266036,"title":"Revamped Changing Breed Sheets available from Mr. Gone!","content":"Yeah, me and Mr. G have been working on cleaning up the W20 Changing Breed sheets for the past couple of weeks just to get rid of a few errors and such. Each Breed now has a more accurate Expanded Backgrounds list, as well as a few optional things from the Breedbooks (such as individual Breed weaknesses) that players include if they like, or leave out if they prefer following the rules in CB20. And there were a few assorted things like making sure that Ananasi had a Blood Pool of 25 instead of 20 as the Ananasi can reach a max Blood Pool of 25 (rather than 20) with sufficient Rank and Gifts.<br /> <br /> Mr. Gone has already uploaded the new sheets onto his website found here:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/img/logo-main.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> MrGone's Character Sheets. </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Collection of Character Sheets created by MrGone. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> For those of you who haven't been there before, just head to the W20 section and scroll down to the W20 Changing Breed Sheets section. 2- and 4-page versions available as per usual.<br /> <br /> Constructive criticism and comments can be posted here on this thread.<br /> <br /> Enjoy!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-09T18:41:24-08:00","id":1266049,"title":"","content":"It seems I am a victim of my own success...which is to say that I'm an impatient bastard. I didn't quite finish proofreading these sheets before making my announcement, but there's an error (a really minor one, all things considered), but on the Rokea sheet, the Primal-Urge difficulty for Glabrus form should be 9, not 7 as only betweeners can learn this form after spending some time on Unsea, and only after some practice; that's what justifies the 9 difficulty.<br /> <br /> I'm still proofreading, but these sheets are looking good so far. And if you guys want to take a look at the present versions and add your two cents, feel free to reply here. Mr. Gone and I appreciate any thoughts and/or questions and comments you guys might have to improve th