"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Torakhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1266036-revamped-changing-breed-sheets-available-from-mr-gone?p=1266354#post1266354\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry I never got around to getting the graphics. :-/</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1266036-revamped-changing-breed-sheets-available-from-mr-gone?p=1266386#post1266386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's ok man. I just made do with what I had. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> If you ever decide to, I can always revisit em. But no biggie.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh, let's give Mr. G a break before we ask him to revisit them. He's already been working hard at my insistence to update these sheets. He's already got a huge amount on his plate and only worked on the Breed sheets as a favor to me when he didn't have to do it. For that, I'll always be grateful.<br /> <br /> Not to mention, I'm curious about whatever else he's working on. <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-11T14:46:48-08:00","id":1266498,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Su-tehp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1266036-revamped-changing-breed-sheets-available-from-mr-gone?p=1266483#post1266483\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I gave Mr. Gone the last of my edits for the Breed sheets this morning so they should be ready and finalized very soon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. I got them updated and re-uploaded, so you should be good. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Su-tehp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1266036-revamped-changing-breed-sheets-available-from-mr-gone?p=1266483#post1266483\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heh, let's give Mr. G a break before we ask him to revisit them. He's already been working hard at my insistence to update these sheets. He's already got a huge amount on his plate and only worked on the Breed sheets as a favor to me when he didn't have to do it. For that, I'll always be grateful.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, you're very welcome. Glad we could get em sorted out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Su-tehp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1266036-revamped-changing-breed-sheets-available-from-mr-gone?p=1266483#post1266483\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not to mention, I'm curious about whatever else he's working on. <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>Got some V5 stuff coming up..and then just a few assorted things here and there.<br /> <br /> I'd like to do some Wraith20 sheets, but I have to figure out how to remake the effect they used for the divider text. So, that's on hold until I can get some time to try replicate that... Anyway, always lots to do. lol.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-11T16:02:23-08:00","id":1266512,"title":"","content":"Mr. G, one last thing (I swear!) to fix on the Corax sheet. I forgot to take into account the Corax combat chart and their Eye Pluck special maneuver. The Revised version of the Corax sheet has the correct maneuvers but the old Revised format, so here's the updated W20 format that you should use for the Corax Brawling Chart on Page 3:<br /> <br /> Brawling Chart<br /> <b>Maneuver Roll Diff Damage</b><br /> Body Slam Dex+Brawl 7 Special/B<br /> Claw Dex+Brawl 6 Strength+2/A<br /> Eye Pluck Dex+Brawl 9 Strength+2/A<br /> +Special<br /> Grapple Dex+Brawl 6 Strength/B<br /> Kick Dex+Brawl 7 Strength+1/B<br /> Punch Dex+Brawl 6 Strength/B<br /> A=Aggravated Damage B=Bashing Damage<br /> <br /> And the Ananasi Brawling Chart still needs the changes I outlined before in my last edit. It's here again, just in case (remember to take into account that the Ananasi have TWO Bite maneuvers because of their Lilian and Pithus forms):<br /> <br /> Brawling Chart<br /> <b>Maneuver Roll Diff Damage</b><br /> Bite (Lilian) Dex + Brawl 5 Strength + 1/A<br /> Bite (Pithus) Dex + Brawl 5 Strength + 3/A<br /> Body Slam Dex + Brawl 7 Special/B<br /> Claw Dex + Brawl 6 Strength + 2/A<br /> Grapple Dex + Brawl 6 Strength/B<br /> Kick Dex + Brawl 7 Strength + 1/B<br /> Punch Dex + Brawl 6 Strength/B<br /> A=Aggravated Damage B=Bashing Damage<br /> <br /> These should be the absolute last changes needed. I sent you an email detailing the last corrections needed as well, Mr. G. Thanks again for all your hard work!<br /> <br /> EDIT: Ugh, the post screwed up the format and spaces between the columns; the Tab button doesn't work in these forums and multiple spaces don't work either. So if it still looks screwed up, just read my docfile that I emailed you. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":2710,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","user":"Su-tehp","date":". 11-11-2018, 07:08 PM